<title>JAPAN: Japan external reserves $221.761 bln at end-May.</title>
<headline>Japan external reserves $221.761 bln at end-May.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's external reserves rose $1.865 billion from a month earlier to a record $221.761 billion at the end of May, the Finance Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>The reserves at the end of April were $219.922 billion, which was up $565 million from the previous month.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
